{"c":[{"name":"20261005T220128Z-48f450097d0ca431","text":"Human pages do not list semantic --harness or --role. Flag home is skills/sr-semantic/SKILL.md; the sr-search route row and the two-path sentence stay.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T164010Z-c6c38050580988bb","text":"Claude message tokens are stored once per (message.id, requestId), field-wise max; a subagent copy of a parent response carries none. Transcripts that are gone are not rewritten.","type":"note"}]}
